Rule 2 (loc and scale must have the same shape if they have the same dimensionality)
{v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_2) = ndim(v_3) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) = shape(v_3, i)
